; PARK AFTER EVERY TOOL CHANGE (operator 2026-08-11: "all MDI tool changes
; should have that ... go to safe height, and rapid to G30 XY and then, go
; to G30 Z. all rapid"). A T0 used to leave the spindle sitting over a fork
; -- an empty taper parked above a tool is where a bumped MPG does damage.
; Sequenced, not a bare G30: clear Z FIRST, then travel, then drop.
; #5181/2/3 are the stored G30 point in MACHINE coordinates.
o<tcpark> sub
  ; RETRACT AND STAY (operator 2026-08-11: "i don't want it to traverse to
  ; g30 automatically anymore. retract to safety and stay there. nothing
  ; else"). Z only -- X and Y are left exactly where the change finished.
  G53 G0 Z0
o<tcpark> endsub
M2
